    (v : ℕ → K) (hv : ∀ m, Tendsto (fun n => moritaAngularMean p (moritaCharacterTwist p ι (moritaTorsionCharacterMap p ι) m) n (fun x => moritaLogDivided ℓ m (ι x))) atTop (𝓝 (v m)))
    : HasDerivAt (moritaDifferenceExtension v) (v 1) 0 := by sorry

